      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Last One Wins\n\nReduces a stream to its final item. Use it at the end of a loop that refines one value, where only the last version matters.\n\n**How it works:** \"Versions\" holds three drafts. \"Fan out\" streams them one at a time into \"Last\", which waits for the stream to end and passes on only the final item. \"Final\" shows that value.\n\n**Try this:** Add a fourth entry to \"Versions\", such as \"approved\", and confirm that \"Final\" now shows it."
        },
